From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kodi-ps4 dev <dev@kodi-ps4.local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:52:36 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] ps4: ABI compatibility for the Orbis toolchain

Replace std::ranges and std::views uses that the Orbis libc++ does not provide, and keep the upstream semantics. This also covers SDK header and integer-width gaps.
